# [Part 2: 极其隐蔽的云托管服务 (Cloud Hosting)]
# ⚠️ 50% 的现代 App 后端跑在这些域名上，漏了会导致 App 空白
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,firebaseapp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudfunctions.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,run.app

