# =======================================================
# [Part 5: 协议层兜底 (User-Agent)]
# 覆盖安装包下载、Webview、语音助手、后台同步

USER-AGENT,*Gmail*
USER-AGENT,*GoogleMap*
USER-AGENT,*GoogleAssistant*
USER-AGENT,*GoogleHome*
USER-AGENT,*Chrome*
USER-AGENT,*youtube*
USER-AGENT,*google*

# =======================================================
# [Part 6: 物理层兜底 (IP-ASN)]
# Blackmatrix7 标准 ASN 列表，包含 Google Cloud 新节点
# =======================================================
# Google LLC (核心流量)
IP-ASN,15169
# Google Cloud (云服务/App后端)
IP-ASN,19527
IP-ASN,36040
IP-ASN,36385
IP-ASN,36492
IP-ASN,396982
# Google Fiber (部分下载源)
IP-ASN,16591
IP-ASN,6432
IP-ASN,43515
# 亚太地区及其他 (缓存节点)
IP-ASN,16550
IP-ASN,11344
IP-ASN,139070
IP-ASN,139190
